/Title (Using @import, it is possible to import style rules from other CSS files and specify the media or media types to which the imported styles should apply. In this case, unlike @media, the URL of the CSS file containing the style sheet is specified first, followed by the target medium to which the styles will be applied. It is important to note that @import rules must appear before all other style rules.)
